    "alt": "Ivory daisies with ochre centers and sage leaves embroidered on oatmeal linen in a wooden hoop.",
    "excerpt": "<p>A little garden, stitched by hand. 🌼 Ivory daisies, golden centers and sage leaves bring quiet charm to a linen embroidery hoop.</p><ul><li>Practice petals on a fabric scrap first.</li><li>Keep your linen gently taut for smoother stitches.</li></ul><p>A lovely idea for slow afternoons and handmade gifts. #BotanicalEmbroidery #DaisyHoop #BeginnerStitches<br>Save for later!</p>",
